Refactor long-lived HTTP mounts and dispatch so /mcp, /view/<name>/mcp, /search/mcp and view listings select the current user's config at request time. Default fallback may use only that user's upstreams if preserving existing semantics. Named missing view/user returns scoped error. Preserve root OAuth discovery and default-versus-remote endpoint distinction. Acceptance: concurrent users sharing URLs see only their own views; dynamic names do not require rebuilding HTTP app; request/session identity tests pass.
